configure terminal
firewall
service name FWS_tcp-5986 proto tcp src all dst port 5986
service name FWS_tcp-3389 proto tcp src all dst port 3389
service name FWS_tcp-23 proto tcp src all dst port 23
service name FWS_tcp_445 proto tcp src all dst port 445
service name FWS_tcp_139 proto tcp src all dst port 139
service name FWS_tcp-5985 proto tcp src all dst port 5985
