service name FWS_tcp_80 proto tcp src all dst port 80
service name FWS_udp-53 proto udp src all dst port 53
service name FWS_tcp-22 proto tcp src all dst port 22
icmp name FWS_icmp-8 type 8 code 0 ver ipv4
icmp name FWS_icmp6-128 type 128 code 0 ver ipv6
icmp name FWS_icmp_3_4 type 3 code 4 ver ipv4
icmp name FWS_icmp_11_0 type 11 code 0 ver ipv4
